# UI Reference Workflow

Before writing or changing UI in this repo, read and follow `ui-workflow.md` at the project root.

## Stack (do not deviate without approval)
- Next.js 16 App Router + React 19 + Tailwind v4 + shadcn primitives in `src/components/ui/`
- Tokens in `src/app/globals.css`; compose with `cn()` from `src/lib/utils.ts`
- Reuse existing components — no new UI libraries or npm deps without explicit approval

## Required process
1. **Inspect** reference sites (shadcn, beautifui, beui, rareui, transitions.dev, etc.) — use live demos
2. **Propose** 2–3 approaches per component with source links — **stop and wait for go-ahead**
3. **Integrate** the chosen approach using project tokens/primitives only
4. **Token pass** — spacing, easing, motion checked against designsystemchecklist.com

## Guardrails
- Patterns must be grounded in the reference sources
- Flag any guesswork where no reference matched
